== 4. six ways of not being believed ==
ok   a changed body: the state island does not match this session and page
ok   a changed mac: the state island does not match this session and page
ok   another session: the state island does not match this session and page
ok   another page: the state island does not match this session and page
ok   past its expiry: the state island has expired
ok   not expiry.mac.body at all: the state island is malformed
ok   no island at all: the document carried no state island

== 5. bounded ==
ok   a page that carries too much is refused at seal: this page's @persist state is 34 bytes and the limit is 16 — persist less, or raise PersistOptions.max_bytes deliberately
ok   nothing to carry is no island: []

