ok   the bad one is reported: "many" is not an int for "cups"
ok   and it keeps its default: 0
ok   while the good one beside it is written: Ada

== 7. the three bytes that would change what it parses as ==
ok   they are escaped on the wire: name=a%26b%3Dc%25d
ok   and come back as they were: a&b=c%d

